## Why This Is Asked
Tests DP on partitioning with non-linear block cost, ensuring ability to precompute substring costs and reconstruct cuts.

## Key Concepts
- Prefix DP with exact k partitions
- Substring cost precomputation (distinct chars)
- Backpointers for reconstruction
- Time/space tradeoffs

## Code Example
